## Stack técnico

| Tecnología | Versión (package-lock) |
|---|---|
| Next.js (Pages Router) | 16.2.6 |
| React / React DOM | 18.3.1 |
| TypeScript | 5.8.3 |
| Tailwind CSS | 3.4.17 |
| PostCSS / Autoprefixer | 8.5.6 / 10.4.21 |
| Framer Motion | 10.18.0 |
| React Icons | 4.12.0 |

Tipografía: Outfit (Google Fonts). Hosting: Netlify.

